      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Canadian Cardiovascular Society. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A single left coronary artery is an extremely rare congenital anomaly that is commonly associated with other congenital cardiac malformations. We present a case involving a single left coronary artery and coronary sinus anomaly demonstrated on coronary angiography and multidetector computed-tomography angiography. To the best of our knowledge, this rare combination has not been reported previously."
      },
